WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:59.590
It's like they're a million miles away.

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:03.640
Now that the Culture Festival and the school trip are over,

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:09.310
and final exams are almost over, my duties as the Student Council President will be done soon.

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:14.190
No! I can still do more!

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:16.780
I should be able to plan some more fun things!

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:20.110
I need to get a boyfriend before the 24th.

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:22.580
No kidding.

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:25.370
You know, if you don't mind, I'll be your boyfriend.

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.000
No way!

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:28.620
Why not?

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:29.540
Eureka!

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:39.010
An Exciting  Christmas

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:52.520
Poster says: Tsumugino High School. You make the best couple! Brought to you by the Student Council. Christmas Cosplay Event. It's official!! Date and time: December 24th from 6PM.

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:56.360
The winner will receive...
Can you believe it?!
They will receive a book entitled
"The Legendary Club Secrets."

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:56.360
You can check it out on the day. Additionally,
all guests should bring a lovely present to exchange.
(Girls should wrap their presents with a red ribbon.
Boys should wrap their presents with a green ribbon.)
Ladies and gentlemen, get your groove on!!

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:56.360
Entry Req: boy-girl couples only

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:56.190
Could this be...

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:58.280
"The Legendary Club Secrets"?

00:02:58.820 --> 00:02:59.780
Are they serious about this?

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:02.990
I must obtain it, no matter what!

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.790
To achieve ultimate beauty!

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:10.000
You wish! It's for the love of baseball!

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:20.930
Posters say: Tsumugino High School. You make the best couple! Brought to you by the Student Council. Christmas Cosplay Event. It's official!!

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:24.640
Sakurai-kun's at it again.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:25.350
The winner will receive... Can you believe it?! They will receive a book entitled "The Legendary Club Secrets." Entry requirements: boy-girl couples (underlined in red) only. You can check it out on the day. Additionally, all guests should bring a lovely present to exchange. Girls should wrap their presents with a red ribbon. Boys should wrap their presents in a green ribbon.  Ladies and gentlemen, get your groove on!! Copyright Tsumugino High School Student Council

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:31.020
"Girls should wrap their presents with a red ribbon.
Boys should wrap their presents with a green ribbon."

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:34.230
He's planned everything.

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.280
Morning, Sayuri!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:45.320
Letters say: To Amamiya Sayuri-sama.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.160
What the hell is this?!

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:47.410
Geez. What on earth is this?

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.910
Only you could attract this much attention.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.420
So many boys sent you a letter about the event so quickly.

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:56.500
What event?

00:03:57.090 --> 00:04:01.260
Sakurai-kun put together a party for Christmas Eve.

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:07.300
Geez. He can create any event he likes, but now he's dragging everyone into it.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:10.060
Well, it's Christmas, after all.

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:13.850
I guess it can't be helped.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:15.350
Geez.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:16.860
He should be more considerate of others.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:19.110
What should I do with these?

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.150
Isn't it obvious?

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:27.620
There's someone you want to go with, isn't there?

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:29.830
I'm not interested.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.540
Hey, what's your problem?

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.580
Nothing. I meant what I said.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.080
Listen up.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.670
What I'm trying to say is...

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:39.090
Like I said, I'm not interested!

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:40.420
I see.

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:42.630
Then you won't mind if I invite him, will you?

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:45.090
AOBA-KUN!

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:47.300
Yes!

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.100
Everyone!

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:53.980
I am going to the Christmas event with Aoba-kun! We'll be a couple!

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.150
WHAT?!

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:01.570
I'm counting on you! ♥

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:04.860
What do you mean, "a couple"?!

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:06.660
Never mind that.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.620
Just hold my hand.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:09.700
Um...

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:11.410
I don't know what you're talking about...

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.960
Hey! What's going on?

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.960
Whatever do you mean, Tsukasa?

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:25.300
You know what I mean. Why did you...

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:26.630
What you see is what you get.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.760
What do you mean?

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.640
<i>I</i>  was going to invite Riku-kun!

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:33.560
Sorry about that.

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:34.980
You were a little late.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:37.060
That's not fair!

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.440
You're in his class, so you've got the upper hand!

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:44.440
Riku-san is going to the event with Shiina-san?

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:46.570
You're still you, Riku-kun!

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:48.860
You don't have to go with Ayame.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.490
I won't allow it!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:53.790
But I haven't agreed to go with anyone yet.

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:54.950
Let's go, Riku.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.330
R-Riku!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.920
H-Hey! We've got class!

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.040
Never mind.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.250
Go out with me.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:03.750
H-Hey!

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.210
Geez!

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:06.260
Damn that Ayame!

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.720
I hate it. I can't stand it.

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:11.510
I want to be near Riku-kun during Christmas Eve.

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:12.760
To do that...

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:14.470
Could it be...

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:16.100
Does he like Shiina-san?

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:20.730
Riku-san must have agreed to go with her.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:22.570
I want to be with him.

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:23.730
I want to be near him.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.740
I want to be near him, just for a little while.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:28.780
But what should I do?

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:35.740
Hey, what'll we do about this event?

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:40.790
It's too sad. We won't get anyone, because we can't get anyone.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:42.880
Well, I guess there's nothing to be done.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.340
U-Um...

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:46.510
Yayoi-san!

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.340
What are you doing here?

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:49.680
H-Hey.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:50.760
Kasuga-san.

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:53.390
Did something happen to you two?

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:11.280
I'm so sorry! I should have apologized earlier!

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:13.280
So? What do you want?

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:14.620
Um...

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:21.080
Inukai-senpai. W-W-Will you be my partner for the Christmas event?

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:25.670
Shut it.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:33.220
I can't speak.

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:36.350
Hey, Hiyoko-kun.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:38.430
What's up with everyone?

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:41.860
Now that Christmas is coming, everyone is in "Love-Mode".

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:43.810
It's the "Season of Love"?

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:50.070
Everyone's so excited about the party. They're trying to find a partner.

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:53.120
In any case, even you, know that there will be trouble again, right?

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:54.910
I guess so.

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:57.620
But why is it like this every day?

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:01.290
Sakurai-kun's events make me wanna cry.

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:05.700
Even crying is part of being young, Riku!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:21.640
Aoba-kun.

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.100
Is he really going out with Ayame?

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:25.270
That can't be right.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.730
But if he really is going out with her...

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:32.360
If that happens, then I'll...

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.070
There you are, Amamiya-kun!

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:36.410
Sakurai-kun?

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:41.870
The flowers of love are blossoming all over school as we approach the Christmas event.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:43.250
Are you really alone?

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:49.210
I think that everyone's really happy with your idea, but I'm not interested.

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:51.420
Well, you don't have to go that far.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:55.430
I was just going to ask you to help me with something.

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:56.760
Again?

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:58.550
What do you want this time?

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:01.850
I'd like you to be my partner that day.

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:03.770
Your partner?

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:06.020
My partner on the organization committee.

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:07.900
I... see.

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:09.900
All right.

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:11.320
You mean it?

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:16.530
Oh, if you're on stage, Amamiya-kun, everyone will throw flowers at you!

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:18.950
This must be the Student Council's...

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:19.950
Responsibility, right?

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:21.580
All right.

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.080
Thank you!

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:25.660
I'm looking forward to it even more with each passing moment!

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:34.840
Welcome!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.880
How about a Christmas cake?

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:39.930
It's 150 yen!

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:40.800
Thank you very much!

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:43.310
Ho! Ho! Ho! Merry Christmas.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:44.980
I'd like this please.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.310
Thank you very much.

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:51.070
I've got a present for him.

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:54.610
I hope Riku-san picks it.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:02.660
But he said to let him handle it...

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.080
Will he be all right?

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.710
Which should I pick?

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.130
I'll get this one!

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:18.180
This will look perfect on him!

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:23.560
Now I've got to spend some time with Suzuki-kun!

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:31.520
Aoba-kun. I wonder what costumes are you and Ayame going to wear?

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:33.980
It'll be just the two of you...

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:40.280
Anyway, I've gotta choose a present.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:54.460
Tokimeki! Memorial! Only Love!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:59.340
I'm Shiina Ayame. Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:12.770
Okay! Please place your presents here.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:17.280
It hasn't started yet.

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:19.550
Just be patient, Doujima.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.530
Magnificent!

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:25.490
All these people! All this enthusiasm!

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:29.620
We've prepared a stage for everyone to make their dreams come true!

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:31.290
I can't wait to tell them about it!

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:33.080
Amamiya-kun.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:35.250
I'm counting on you to be my assistant today.

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:44.890
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:47.180
I will be your host this evening!

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:50.140
I'm the real Santa!

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:55.480
Now then, let us begin our Student Council Christmas Cosplay Event!

00:11:58.190 --> 00:12:04.110
Allow me to introduce my assistant for the evening... Miss Santa!

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:04.820
Come in!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.660
She's so cute!

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:10.870
Who is she?

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:12.040
Aoba can't win.

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:17.630
Oh... I can't believe Sakurai-kun made me wear this.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:21.550
But, if I can get close to Aoba-kun...

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:25.840
Now then, let us meet our first couple!

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:31.980
First up are Yori Yurito and Super Three X!

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:37.020
Super Three  X!

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:39.690
Merry...

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:45.530
Christ...

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:50.540
Mas!!!!!!!!!!

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:51.750
Take this!

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:57.290
How'd you like the Bukatsu Final Move?

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:57.290
Note: "Bukatsu" means clubs.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:58.590
You underestimated us!

00:12:58.590 --> 00:12:59.840
This isn't cosplay!

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.380
Will this be all right?

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:06.180
Most assuredly! With our uniforms - the Tokimeki Costume!

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:09.220
And we've got our Tokimeki Play!

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.060
It's perfect!

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:11.770
That's okay then.

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:25.320
I'm sorry that this costume didn't meet your expectations.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:29.160
Wow! It's so exciting to be your partner, Yayoi-san.

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:34.250
I knew you could do it, but I still envy you, Mii-chan!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:38.170
Now then, our next act will be the Kasuga-Suzuki pair!

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:40.250
The Snow White Couple!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:41.590
Ta-da!

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:44.050
We'll show you our winning moves!

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:46.260
I don't know what to say.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:51.560
I just wanted to be alone with Riku-kun.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:56.690
Tsukasa really hates me for this.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.440
I guess she's trying hard.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.270
Huh? Did you say something?

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:01.820
No. Nothing at all.

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.780
But even so, Sayuri.

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:05.360
I wonder what you're planning to do.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:07.740
What's wrong with Amamiya-san?

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:19.290
Are you curious... about Sayuri?

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.590
Wh-What are you saying, Shiina-san?

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:25.340
Hey, Shiina-san.

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:26.380
Won't you tell me?

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:28.630
Why did you drag me into this?

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:29.970
Who knows?

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:32.140
Maybe I really do like you.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:34.600
Shiina-san?!

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:40.270
Okay! Now we have just one final couple in the cosplay contest!

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.810
The Shiina-Aoba pair!

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:45.690
Reindeer #1 and Reindeer #2.

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.320
Everyone's staring at us.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:53.620
I want to switch places with Shiina-san.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:56.830
That Ayame! She's glued to Riku-kun!

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:01.750
Aoba-kun! Watch out!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:03.170
Sorry.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.210
Geez. Get a grip.

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:13.600
Now, while we count the votes, get ready for the Present Exchange!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.220
YEAH!

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:17.220
Good, good.

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:21.230
Sketch of the Event Grounds

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:21.230
Detonation Switch

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:21.230
Fireworks

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:21.230
Stage

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:21.230
Huge Tree

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:20.730
Everything's going according to plan.

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:24.440
I can't wait to set off my booby trap at the final curtain!

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:31.070
Everyone's gonna be so surprised when they open the gift box and discover that they've activated the fireworks detonator.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.660
Now, then...

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:34.870
Huh?

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:36.990
Where's the gift box?

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:46.550
Now then, the first ones to pick a present will be those who participated in the cosplay contest!

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:47.750
Aoba-kun!

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:49.260
We'll start with you!

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:51.090
Me?!

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.050
Aoba-kun?

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:57.560
I hope he picks my present from among all the presents.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:01.140
How can I pick one out of so many presents?

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:07.320
Oh, God, please let Riku-kun pick my present.

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:11.820
May my feelings reach Riku-san...

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:15.240
Aoba-kun.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:19.370
S-Sakurai-kun!

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:21.160
Oh, Horeyma-onee-san.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.210
This event has been a great success thanks to you.

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:27.840
One of the presents with a red ribbon is the detonator for the fireworks! It's mixed up with the other presents!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:28.840
WHAT?!

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:31.380
Anyway, you can't let anyone open any presents!

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:34.840
Well, I don't know what's inside.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:35.970
I'll pick this one.

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:36.890
Aoba-kun!

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:37.970
STOP!

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:40.720
Let's see...

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:42.230
NOOO!!

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:56.910
Who are you?

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:57.820
What's wrong?

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.000
Huh?

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.420
One of the presents is "The Legend of the Clubs."

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:12.090
I can feel the spirit of sportsmanship.

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:14.510
This is for eternal youth!

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:36.700
My present...

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:40.240
The dolphin mug is up in the sky...

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:42.660
Well, we're all safe, and that's all that matters.

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:47.670
Maybe I should have used a different-colored ribbon.

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:53.670
Are you all right?

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:12.900
What a day.

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:17.450
Come to think of it, I was the only one who got a present.

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:19.030
This watch...

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.410
Who was it from?

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:27.830
Aoba-kun.

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.250
Good work.

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:31.540
Amamiya-san?

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:08.120
I see.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.830
That must've been hard for you.

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:11.580
Yeah.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:14.460
Sakurai-kun did a good job, but that's all.

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:17.420
I didn't see you there at all, Amamiya-san.

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:20.550
I was wearing a mask.

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:23.300
That's right.

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.720
That "Miss Santa" girl. I wonder who she was.

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:30.190
Huh? Did something happen to her?

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:31.560
Oh, it's not that.

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:32.900
I'm a little curious about her.

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:44.160
Oh, but even so, Shiina-san was so unreasonable.

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:45.450
What do you mean?

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:48.830
She just chose me on a whim.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:52.080
I see.

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:53.580
She's so whimsical.

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:54.290
Yeah.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:55.000
She's just whimsical.

00:19:56.460 --> 00:20:00.130
Say, what present did you give?

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:05.300
Well, I'd like to keep it a secret.

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:06.140
Why?

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:08.640
You can tell me.

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:11.270
Oh, it's really nothing special.

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:13.060
Um...

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:17.020
It's just a barrette.

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:18.110
A barrette?

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:20.990
Were you thinking of Ayame when you bought it?

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:24.700
No, I thought it'd look good on someone with pretty hair.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:37.340
Christmas Eve is over.

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:38.750
That's true.

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:41.260
A year has passed by in an instant.

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.300
So much has happened.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.640
Yes, indeed.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:50.520
I wonder if we'll have even more fun next year.

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:52.180
I think we will.

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.600
No. I'm sure we will.

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:01.570
But I'll be lonely when New Year's Day dawns.

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:03.530
Why's that?

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:07.620
My parents will probably be busy, and they won't be home on New Year's Day.

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:09.780
Will you be alone, Aoba-kun?

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.450
That must be very hard for you.

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:16.210
Well, it's just for a few days, so I'll manage somehow.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:22.630
Aoba-kun.

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:24.590
What time is it now?

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:28.720
Oh, it's almost 10PM!

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.260
We should be heading home soon.

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:32.180
Yeah.

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:32.810
Good idea.

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:44.360
Honestly. They cause me so much trouble.

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:18.900
Merry Christmas.

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:27.450
My heart is overflowing!

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:42.710
My heart is overflowing!Even if I try to conceal my feelings for you,

00:22:43.550 --> 00:22:48.590
I can't help blushing when our eyes meet.

00:22:50.840 --> 00:22:57.310
I kept this a secret from my friends,

00:22:58.100 --> 00:23:03.730
Because I didn't want to be teased.

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:13.070
The important thing that nobody knows,

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:20.210
I'll only tell to you.

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:25.000
These gently falling flower petals

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:28.590
are sneaking into my heart.

00:23:29.010 --> 00:23:34.970
I want to make your heart flutter.

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:39.560
It's okay to have hopes

00:23:39.930 --> 00:23:43.230
for the future we await, right?

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:49.440
My heart is overflowing!

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:52.780
Next Episode Preview

00:23:50.820 --> 00:23:51.990
It's New Year's!

00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:53.740
New Year is upon us!

00:23:53.740 --> 00:23:55.410
What's up, Utsumi-senpai?

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:56.620
You look like you're having fun.

00:23:56.620 --> 00:23:58.830
Yeah. It'll be a new year very soon.

00:23:58.830 --> 00:24:00.960
We can wear kimonos!

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:02.870
Aoba

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:10.970
Oh! I can tighten my obi to make myself look skinny! That's why I love wearing a kimono! I can't wait!

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:10.970
Note: An "obi" is a belt worn with a kimono.

00:24:11.340 --> 00:24:13.840
Next time on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:13.840 --> 00:24:15.220
An Exciting New Year.

00:24:15.250 --> 00:24:16.130
Please watch it.

00:24:16.470 --> 00:24:19.020
Senpai must be going through tough times.
